{
    "title": "WatchMaker Watch Faces",
    "description": "WatchMaker is the #1 watch faces platform in the world, with millions of smartwatch users. With the largest repository of 100,000+ smart watch faces collection and community in the world, WatchMaker allows you to fully customize your watch face, using text, images, shaders, custom expressions and much more!\r\n\r\nWhy keep buying watchfaces in 2023? Join millions who paid once to unlock WatchMaker Premium and gained access to 100,000+ stunning watchfaces! With tons more watches added every day!!\r\n\r\n<b>100,000 WATCH FACES</b>\r\n\r\nInstantly get everything you need to customize & personalize your Android Watch, Galaxy Watch or Apple Watch Faces!\r\n\r\nWATCHMAKER NOW SUPPORTS SAMSUNG GALAXY WATCH 6/5/ACTIVE WATCH*\r\n\r\nAll Wear OS devices supported\r\n\r\nFeatures exclusive to WatchMaker - Watch Faces:\r\n\u2022 100,000+ high-quality iwatch faces instantly available from our MeWe page https://bit.ly/2ITrvII\r\n\u2022 10,000+ watch hands and backgrounds in watch designer!\r\n\u2022 Select a color to suit your mood!\r\n\u2022 Create your own faces with the most powerful design tools available!\r\n\u2022 Animated GIFs - Add custom animations to your watch face!\r\n\u2022 3d Gyroscope - Create an amazing parallax effect!\r\n\u2022 Interactive Clock - Create hotspots to launch watch or phone apps!\r\n\u2022 Animations - Create bright / dim / tap animations with 45 tweening functions!\r\n\u2022 Calendar - Choose which calendars to show!\r\n\u2022 Weather / Moon Icons - Add in 1-click!\r\n\u2022 Countdowns - Days until your birthday, Christmas, etc!\r\n\u2022 Cool Text Effects - Add glow, outline, even flat shadow!\r\n\u2022 1-Click Widgets - Including battery (watch/phone) + WiFi widgets!\r\n\u2022 OpenGL Shaders - Powerful rendering for watch segments, radars\r\n\u2022 Free Watch Faces - 10,000+ watchfaces from our huge MeWe community! http://bit.ly/wm-mewe\r\n\u2022 Tasker - Full tasker integration\r\n\u2022 Compass - Add a rotating compass or bearing\r\n\u2022 Stopwatch - Why design a watch when you can build a stopwatch?!\r\n\u2022 Multiple Time Zone - Set up to 3 custom time zones\r\n\u2022 Heart rate and step counter for fitness\r\n\u2022 Programmable Watches use our built-in LUA engine to make calculators, stopwatches, countdowns, anything you like!\r\n\u2022 Complications - Step counter / Pedometer / Calendar / Fallout + many more!\r\n\r\nAlso features :\r\n\u2022 Very low battery usage!\r\n\u2022 100s of new watches each week!\r\n\u2022 Weather Data\r\n\u2022 Supports round and square faces\r\n\u2022 Selection of analog and digital clocks!\r\n\u2022 Collection of ladies, girly, feminine, women's watch faces\r\n\u2022 Compatible with all Wear OS watches\r\n\r\nPricing\r\n\u2022 You get 100 watches for free!\r\n\u2022 Premium is $7.99: 200 featured watches each week and exclusive access to 100,000+ faces from our MeWe community, watchawear.com + use your own images in watchfaces\r\n\r\nSupported watches :\r\n\u2022 All Wear OS by Google\r\n\u2022 Apple Watch\r\n\u2022 Armani Exchange Connected\r\n\u2022 ASUS ZenWatch (1/2/3)\r\n\u2022 Casio Smart Outdoor/Pro Trek\r\n\u2022 Diesel On Full Guard\r\n\u2022 Elephone Ele\r\n\u2022 Emporio Armani EA\r\n\u2022 Fossil Q Explorist/Founder/Marshal/Q Control/Sport/Venture/Wander\r\n\u2022 GUESS Ace/Connect/Cassidy/Jemma\r\n\u2022 Huawei Watch (1/2)\r\n\u2022 Hugo Boss Touch\r\n\u2022 Kate Spade Scallop\r\n\u2022 LG G Watch\r\n\u2022 LG G Watch R\r\n\u2022 LG Watch Sport\r\n\u2022 LG Watch Style\r\n\u2022 LG Watch Urbane (1/2)\r\n\u2022 Louis Vuitton Tambour Horizon\r\n\u2022 Michael Kors Access\r\n\u2022 Misfit Vapor (1/2)\r\n\u2022 Montblanc Summit\r\n\u2022 Motorola 360 (1/2/womens/sport)\r\n\u2022 Movado Connect\r\n\u2022 New Balance RunIQ\r\n\u2022 Nixon Mission\r\n\u2022 OPPO Watch\r\n\u2022 Polar M600\r\n\u2022 Samsung Galaxy Watch 6 (1/2/3/4/5) + Active 1/2\r\n\u2022 Samsung Gear S2/S3\r\n\u2022 Samsung Gear Live\r\n\u2022 Samsung Gear Sport\r\n\u2022 Skagen Falster\r\n\u2022 Sony Smartwatch 3\r\n\u2022 Suunto 7\r\n\u2022 TAG Heuer Connected\r\n\u2022 Ticwatch E\r\n\u2022 Ticwatch S\r\n\u2022 Ticwatch Pro (+ other models 1/2/C2/S)\r\n\u2022 Tommy Hilfiger TH24/7\r\n\u2022 Verizon Wear24\r\n\u2022 Xiaomi Mi Watch\r\n\u2022 ZTE Quartz\r\n\u2022 Many more!\r\n\r\nJoin our MeWe / Reddit community and get free watch faces :\r\nMEWE: https://bit.ly/2ITrvII\r\nREDDIT: http://goo.gl/0b6up9\r\nWIKI: http://goo.gl/Fc9Pz8\r\n\r\nJoin the World\u2019s Largest Smart Watch Faces Platform in the World!",
